WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.840
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:38.110 --> 01:43.060
[Shadow Punisher]

3
01:43.130 --> 01:43.710
[Divine Constable Tally]

4
01:43.710 --> 01:45.940
[Episode 19]

5
01:46.640 --> 01:47.560
Qin Dayuan,

6
01:49.560 --> 01:51.479
I know you can hear me.

7
01:53.070 --> 01:55.000
Didn't you set up these 7 fish tanks

8
01:55.229 --> 01:56.039
just to let me

9
01:56.039 --> 01:57.430
see through the mechanism

10
01:57.430 --> 01:58.870
and lure me to this place?

11
02:00.040 --> 02:01.070
If so,

12
02:01.480 --> 02:03.510
why are you hiding now?

13
02:15.560 --> 02:16.280
If I recall correctly,

14
02:16.280 --> 02:17.590
Tang Wei was unmarried, right?

15
02:17.590 --> 02:18.310
Yes.

16
02:18.560 --> 02:20.430
Tang Yiming died 10 years ago.

17
02:20.590 --> 02:22.280
Tang Wei attained an epiphany and devoted himself to Taoism,

18
02:22.280 --> 02:23.540
vowing never to marry.

19
02:23.680 --> 02:24.710
If so,

20
02:25.000 --> 02:25.860
check that out.

21
02:27.870 --> 02:28.630
Why is there

22
02:28.630 --> 02:29.960
a baby's pillow?

23
02:30.150 --> 02:31.360
And why is this baby's pillow

24
02:31.360 --> 02:32.800
made of stone?

25
02:48.590 --> 02:50.650
The fish tanks are all in the same spot

26
02:51.030 --> 02:52.190
in each room from the 1st floor

27
02:52.190 --> 02:53.430
to the 7th.

28
02:55.630 --> 02:58.690
The spots where the moonlight reflects on the ceilings

29
02:59.210 --> 03:01.240
through the fish tanks,

30
03:01.430 --> 03:03.030
from the 1st to the 7th floors,

31
03:03.030 --> 03:04.590
are also almost the same.

32
03:11.470 --> 03:13.200
Except for this huge deviation

33
03:14.190 --> 03:15.840
on the 7th floor.

34
03:16.870 --> 03:18.120
This is due to

35
03:20.190 --> 03:22.190
the different height of this floor.

36
03:22.240 --> 03:22.960
Each floor

37
03:22.960 --> 03:25.000
of Lanyue Pavilion from the 1st to the 6th

38
03:25.000 --> 03:26.680
is about 5 meters high.

39
03:27.000 --> 03:28.310
But this 7th floor

40
03:28.750 --> 03:30.520
is clearly much shorter.

41
03:30.840 --> 03:32.770
There's only one way to explain it—

42
03:32.960 --> 03:34.800
there is a hidden space

43
03:35.430 --> 03:37.280
above this 7th floor.

44
05:16.040 --> 05:17.070
Something's off.

45
05:17.630 --> 05:19.560
This mechanism is way too obvious.

46
05:19.750 --> 05:21.800
We just found out Tang Wei committed suicide,

47
05:21.800 --> 05:22.540
and then you guys

48
05:22.540 --> 05:24.430
found his suicide note so quickly?

49
05:24.430 --> 05:26.030
Tang Wei's parents are dead.

50
05:26.070 --> 05:27.530
He had no wife or children.

51
05:27.630 --> 05:29.040
Then who did he

52
05:29.480 --> 05:31.040
write this suicide note to?

53
05:31.430 --> 05:32.690
And who does this word,

54
05:33.040 --> 05:34.510
"you," refer to?

55
05:34.800 --> 05:36.730
Seems like Tang Wei's suicide note

56
05:37.480 --> 05:38.870
was also meant for us.

57
06:30.560 --> 06:31.480
Qin Dayuan,

58
06:32.270 --> 06:34.040
if you still don't show yourself,

59
06:34.040 --> 06:35.870
don't blame me for being rude.

60
07:16.160 --> 07:16.950
Huang Gang.

61
07:24.630 --> 07:25.600
Jiang Zeshui.

62
07:25.830 --> 07:27.510
Ascend to Heaven.

63
07:33.680 --> 07:35.220
Is this

64
07:35.560 --> 07:38.820
General Hu Hai who jumped into the furnace for liberation?

65
08:00.190 --> 08:02.270
I once read the records in Tianshu Pavilion.

66
08:02.270 --> 08:04.560
"Liluo has pearls, often seen in darkness;

67
08:04.560 --> 08:07.190
they don't gleam like the moon, but blaze like the sun."

68
08:07.190 --> 08:08.630
So it's a luminous pearl.

69
08:08.800 --> 08:10.630
Throughout the records of hundreds of years,

70
08:10.630 --> 08:12.070
there is only one luminous pearl

71
08:12.070 --> 08:13.200
as large as this one.

72
08:13.240 --> 08:15.120
It is Liluo's national treasure,

73
08:15.270 --> 08:16.200
the Mirror Moon.

74
08:16.430 --> 08:18.040
After Liluo fell, they searched

75
08:18.040 --> 08:19.020
the entire national treasury

76
08:19.020 --> 08:20.360
but failed to find this Mirror Moon.

77
08:20.360 --> 08:21.830
Never thought it would be here.

78
08:21.830 --> 08:22.950
Tang Yiming was an official

79
08:22.950 --> 08:25.040
credited with conquering Liluo back then.

80
08:25.040 --> 08:26.160
He must have

81
08:26.480 --> 08:27.530
looted plenty of treasures

82
08:27.530 --> 08:29.330
from the Liluo Imperial Palace.

83
08:30.750 --> 08:33.150
Who exactly is this corpse?

84
08:38.630 --> 08:39.549
Qin Dayuan?

85
08:40.240 --> 08:42.080
Then who is

86
08:42.360 --> 08:43.690
inside this 4th statue?

87
08:44.080 --> 08:44.910
The corpse

88
08:44.910 --> 08:46.550
inside this 4th statue

89
08:47.150 --> 08:49.080
is the former Minister of Works.

90
08:52.510 --> 08:53.910
He was also my master,

91
08:55.120 --> 08:56.080
Tang Yiming.

92
08:57.910 --> 08:59.440
Why is he here?

93
08:59.910 --> 09:01.370
He went missing 3 days ago.

94
09:01.510 --> 09:02.840
Why did he die here?

95
09:11.870 --> 09:12.960
Butler Qin.

96
09:17.510 --> 09:18.960
It must've been rough,

97
09:19.840 --> 09:21.840
lurking in the darkness

98
09:21.910 --> 09:23.910
on the 8th floor of Lanyue Pavilion.

99
09:23.960 --> 09:25.160
But it's reasonable.

100
09:25.910 --> 09:28.360
The Divine Constable Bureau is searching everywhere.

101
09:28.360 --> 09:30.020
There's no way you can escape.

102
09:30.080 --> 09:30.910
Well?

103
09:32.270 --> 09:33.270
At this point,

104
09:34.440 --> 09:36.500
are you still not going to come clean?

105
09:41.320 --> 09:42.650
How should I come clean?

106
09:43.670 --> 09:44.650
Why don't we

107
09:45.510 --> 09:47.360
start with Kongyuzi?

108
09:51.080 --> 09:53.080
Since you mentioned this name,

109
09:53.960 --> 09:55.910
you must know she was my wife.

110
09:56.150 --> 09:58.150
You were husband and wife after all.

111
09:59.080 --> 10:01.270
Why did you have to kill her?

112
10:04.720 --> 10:05.510
Because

113
10:06.670 --> 10:07.910
there was one thing

114
10:08.510 --> 10:09.910
you couldn't accomplish

115
10:10.440 --> 10:12.510
without killing her.

116
10:14.870 --> 10:16.470
Divine Constable Qingyang.

117
10:18.960 --> 10:20.440
Do you want to guess...

118
10:23.080 --> 10:24.360
what I

119
10:25.240 --> 10:26.100
accomplished?

120
10:30.960 --> 10:31.790
Huang Gang,

121
10:32.960 --> 10:34.080
Jiang Zeshui,

122
10:34.320 --> 10:35.840
Hu Hai, Tang Yiming—

123
10:36.080 --> 10:37.150
the four of them

124
10:37.360 --> 10:39.420
once joined forces to destroy Liluo.

125
10:40.080 --> 10:41.200
Their deaths

126
10:42.080 --> 10:43.790
are Liluo's revenge.

127
10:44.120 --> 10:45.630
You got it half right.

128
10:46.240 --> 10:47.640
Huang Gang and the others

129
10:48.550 --> 10:50.240
caused too much bloodshed

130
10:50.720 --> 10:52.250
when they destroyed Liluo,

131
10:52.670 --> 10:54.020
so it was only natural

132
10:54.080 --> 10:55.340
for them to feel uneasy

133
10:56.080 --> 10:57.550
when they got old.

134
11:00.720 --> 11:02.480
Hu Hai and the other two were long in the tooth.

135
11:02.480 --> 11:03.200
Because they had

136
11:03.200 --> 11:05.260
their hands coated in too much blood,

137
11:05.270 --> 11:06.670
they were scared of death

138
11:06.960 --> 11:08.720
and sought medical help everywhere,

139
11:08.720 --> 11:11.030
but to little avail.

140
11:13.440 --> 11:14.240
Therefore,

141
11:14.870 --> 11:16.480
Mr. Tang told them

142
11:16.840 --> 11:19.970
that he knew the way to seek immortality and liberation.

143
11:20.390 --> 11:21.200
Hu Hai

144
11:22.630 --> 11:24.060
was the first one.

145
11:24.480 --> 11:25.480
The Young Master built

146
11:25.480 --> 11:27.240
a secret passage in the sword-forging furnace.

147
11:27.240 --> 11:29.910
When Hu Hai fell into the furnace for liberation,

148
11:29.910 --> 11:32.200
he took Hu Hai away, killed him,

149
11:32.360 --> 11:33.550
and sealed him here.

150
11:33.870 --> 11:35.870
Mr. Tang couldn't use martial arts.

151
11:36.440 --> 11:37.270
So of course,

152
11:37.510 --> 11:39.240
the Liluo demon-men helped him

153
11:39.320 --> 11:40.980
do everything you mentioned.

154
11:41.870 --> 11:44.390
But Huang Gang and Jiang Zeshui

155
11:44.670 --> 11:46.870
were no easy marks like Hu Hai.

156
11:47.510 --> 11:48.320
So,

157
11:49.360 --> 11:51.840
you renovated the Jiang Mansion and Huang Mansion,

158
11:51.840 --> 11:53.080
using Lanweichun

159
11:53.550 --> 11:55.270
to hide the image of Haiqu,

160
11:55.270 --> 11:56.600
Liluo's God of Revenge,

161
11:56.670 --> 11:58.550
in the mural.

162
11:58.870 --> 12:00.480
This caused Haiqu's figure

163
12:00.550 --> 12:02.080
to flicker in and out of view,

164
12:02.080 --> 12:03.240
forcing the two veterans

165
12:03.240 --> 12:05.200
to believe in

166
12:05.480 --> 12:07.810
Tang Wei's theory of mystic cultivation.

167
12:13.030 --> 12:13.870
That day,

168
12:14.720 --> 12:16.270
Mr. Tang accurately foretold

169
12:16.270 --> 12:17.600
the date of his own death

170
12:17.840 --> 12:20.080
and jumped from this Lanyue Pavilion,

171
12:20.550 --> 12:23.080
convincing Huang Gang and the others

172
12:23.080 --> 12:24.270
completely.

173
12:24.870 --> 12:25.720
And then,

174
12:26.320 --> 12:28.120
he entrusted everything to you,

175
12:28.630 --> 12:30.320
leaving you to carry out

176
12:30.320 --> 12:31.750
the rest of the plan.

177
12:36.080 --> 12:37.680
You guessed this part right.

178
12:40.360 --> 12:42.220
In order to achieve immortality,

179
12:42.840 --> 12:43.720
they all

180
12:44.080 --> 12:46.140
ended up believing Tang Wei's words.

181
12:47.240 --> 12:48.030
Hence,

182
12:48.320 --> 12:50.720
Huang Gang climbed up the "heaven ladder,"

183
12:51.120 --> 12:52.850
Jiang Zeshui crossed the lake,

184
12:53.440 --> 12:55.270
and Hu Hai jumped into the sword-forging furnace.

185
12:55.270 --> 12:56.360
But in the end,

186
12:57.270 --> 12:59.080
they were all captured by the Liluo demon-men

187
12:59.080 --> 13:00.440
and brought here.

188
13:02.510 --> 13:04.440
With the Liluo people on my side,

189
13:04.440 --> 13:05.440
why would I go

190
13:05.440 --> 13:07.080
to so much trouble

191
13:07.320 --> 13:10.050
instead of asking them to kill the guys directly?

192
13:11.720 --> 13:13.580
You made Lord Huang and the others

193
13:13.840 --> 13:15.790
believe that ascension was real,

194
13:16.360 --> 13:18.120
only to reveal everything

195
13:18.120 --> 13:19.910
at the very last moment when they were

196
13:19.910 --> 13:21.440
so close to fulfilling their wishes,

197
13:21.440 --> 13:22.510
and tell them

198
13:22.720 --> 13:25.480
that ascension was actually a lie,

199
13:26.080 --> 13:28.080
letting them die in fear.

200
13:29.120 --> 13:30.000
Only in this way

201
13:30.630 --> 13:33.790
could the revenge be satisfying.

202
13:34.320 --> 13:35.750
The Master reached the immortal land.

203
13:35.750 --> 13:38.080
The whole Huang family fell off the cliff.

204
13:38.360 --> 13:39.870
Hu Hai's beloved little granddaughter

205
13:39.870 --> 13:40.870
took poison.

206
13:41.750 --> 13:43.810
If we hadn't arrived in time that day,

207
13:44.080 --> 13:47.340
the whole Jiang family would have drowned in the lake, too.

208
13:51.320 --> 13:53.180
What a cruel and ruthless scheme.

209
13:54.080 --> 13:55.150
To seek revenge,

210
13:56.080 --> 13:58.140
you wiped out their entire families.

211
13:58.440 --> 14:01.670
Huang Gang, Jiang Zeshui, and Hu Hai.

212
14:02.320 --> 14:04.380
I brought the three of them over here.

213
14:04.510 --> 14:06.550
I told them ascension was a lie,

214
14:07.080 --> 14:08.600
and it was their greed

215
14:09.720 --> 14:11.520
that got their families killed,

216
14:11.840 --> 14:13.480
leaving them crying out

217
14:13.720 --> 14:15.240
in remorse

218
14:15.320 --> 14:17.270
with no response.

219
14:18.080 --> 14:19.010
My Lord, My Lady!

220
14:19.270 --> 14:20.270
My Lord, My Lady,

221
14:20.270 --> 14:21.120
Lord Yan reported that

222
14:21.120 --> 14:21.870
Divine Constable Qingyang

223
14:21.870 --> 14:23.600
went up Lanyue Pavilion alone!

224
14:23.720 --> 14:25.240
He went to Lanyue Pavilion alone.

225
14:25.240 --> 14:26.100
Could it be that

226
14:26.630 --> 14:27.960
he found out something?

227
14:29.120 --> 14:31.050
There is one thing that puzzles me.

228
14:31.630 --> 14:33.160
Tang Wei is one of the Tangs.

229
14:34.030 --> 14:36.030
Why would he take revenge for Liluo?

230
14:39.720 --> 14:41.920
Master Tang had a large and rich family,

231
14:42.150 --> 14:44.240
yet Tang Wei was his only child.

232
14:45.360 --> 14:46.080
Could it be...

233
14:46.080 --> 14:51.390
Because Tang Yiming was impotent.

234
14:52.150 --> 14:54.240
Tang Wei was not Tang Yiming's child?

235
14:55.320 --> 14:56.550
He was from Liluo?

236
15:01.080 --> 15:04.280
Divine Constable Qingyang, you've finally got it right.

237
15:05.360 --> 15:07.030
How about I tell you

238
15:07.320 --> 15:08.360
a story?

239
15:12.550 --> 15:13.880
Forty-seven years ago,

240
15:14.910 --> 15:17.240
Great Shi attacked the capital of Liluo,

241
15:18.670 --> 15:22.080
while the Moon Queen of the Kingdom of Liluo, Qiangong Linglong,

242
15:22.080 --> 15:23.600
was about to give birth.

243
15:25.860 --> 15:28.490
[Qiangong Linglong, Regent Moon Queen of Liluo]

244
15:39.030 --> 15:40.360
Greetings, Moon Queen.

245
15:40.960 --> 15:43.290
Who is the father of the child in your womb?

246
15:43.360 --> 15:45.090
Please forgive me, Moon Queen.

247
15:45.240 --> 15:46.630
The child is innocent.

248
15:47.150 --> 15:48.270
My child

249
15:48.630 --> 15:50.360
is also your child.

250
15:50.670 --> 15:52.120
He will surely dedicate everything

251
15:52.120 --> 15:54.630
to you, Holy Queen.

252
15:54.870 --> 15:56.420
Please don't kill him.

253
15:56.960 --> 15:59.690
Please allow him to sacrifice himself for Liluo.

254
16:02.910 --> 16:05.110
You are very loyal to me, the Holy Queen.

255
16:05.630 --> 16:06.670
In this case,

256
16:07.670 --> 16:08.750
I hereby allow you

257
16:08.960 --> 16:11.150
to sacrifice your life for Liluo.

258
16:23.510 --> 16:24.750
I see.

259
16:26.320 --> 16:28.380
Thank you for your mercy, Moon Queen.

260
17:17.579 --> 17:18.450
[Huang Gang]

261
17:23.220 --> 17:24.990
[Jiang Zeshui]

262
17:39.730 --> 17:41.350
[Hu Hai]

263
17:52.780 --> 17:54.550
[Tang Yiming]

264
18:07.030 --> 18:08.480
She is in the Moon Robe.

265
18:08.650 --> 18:10.920
Holy Queen, Qiangong Linglong.

266
18:11.070 --> 18:12.600
We must eliminate the root!

267
18:13.200 --> 18:14.000
Hold on!

268
18:16.270 --> 18:19.010
The child is innocent.

269
18:20.640 --> 18:21.440
Tell me!

270
18:22.350 --> 18:23.760
Where is the treasure vault

271
18:23.760 --> 18:24.400
of Liluo?

272
18:24.830 --> 18:26.110
Tell us what you know,

273
18:26.110 --> 18:27.680
and we can spare your life.

274
18:27.840 --> 18:28.960
You are wrong.

275
18:29.880 --> 18:31.540
Liluo's sorcery is powerful.

276
18:31.640 --> 18:33.110
Only if we kill their leader

277
18:33.110 --> 18:34.720
can we shatter their morale

278
18:34.720 --> 18:36.450
and secure a complete victory.

279
18:36.510 --> 18:38.200
Let me be frank with you.

280
18:38.640 --> 18:40.300
We'll both take the treasures

281
18:40.350 --> 18:42.070
and your life.

282
18:42.510 --> 18:43.440
However,

283
18:43.640 --> 18:45.310
if you tell us,

284
18:45.880 --> 18:47.880
we can give you a quick death.

285
18:48.880 --> 18:50.140
Will you tell us or not?

286
18:50.640 --> 18:52.040
Guys, guys, listen to me.

287
18:52.310 --> 18:53.270
Having the Moon Queen of Liluo

288
18:53.270 --> 18:54.720
and the little prince as hostages,

289
18:54.720 --> 18:55.960
we can make the remnants of Liluo

290
18:55.960 --> 18:56.960
hesitate to attack

291
18:56.960 --> 18:58.110
and yield to us.

292
18:58.750 --> 18:59.720
Tang,

293
19:00.030 --> 19:01.550
do not be excessively soft-hearted.

294
19:01.550 --> 19:02.880
She is at death's door

295
19:02.880 --> 19:04.070
and still refuses to say anything.

296
19:04.070 --> 19:05.480
The so-called Liluo treasures

297
19:05.480 --> 19:07.200
are probably just a rumor.

298
19:07.310 --> 19:08.110
That's right.

299
19:08.480 --> 19:10.480
We can kill this woman first

300
19:10.510 --> 19:12.440
and then go look for the treasures.

301
19:13.960 --> 19:15.640
Let's go find the treasures.

302
19:15.640 --> 19:16.310
Understood!

303
19:16.310 --> 19:17.110
Let's go.

304
19:26.110 --> 19:26.920
Guys,

305
19:26.920 --> 19:28.310
we've killed the enemy leader.

306
19:28.310 --> 19:29.750
We won.

307
19:29.880 --> 19:32.350
Long live His Majesty! All hail Great Shi!

308
19:32.350 --> 19:35.160
-Long live His Majesty! All hail Great Shi! -Long live His Majesty! All hail Great Shi!

309
19:35.160 --> 19:36.960
Tang, what are you waiting for?

310
19:37.310 --> 19:38.480
His Majesty has decreed

311
19:38.480 --> 19:39.720
to arrange a 3-day celebration

312
19:39.720 --> 19:41.190
for us outside the city.

313
19:43.770 --> 19:47.840
Save my child...

314
19:52.270 --> 19:53.830
They didn't know that

315
19:53.980 --> 19:55.100
after they left,

316
19:55.590 --> 19:58.020
my master granted that woman's request

317
19:58.050 --> 20:00.550
and saved her child before she died.

318
20:18.640 --> 20:20.370
Master Tang felt sorry for them

319
20:20.650 --> 20:22.210
and took the child in.

320
20:23.080 --> 20:25.910
That child was Tang Wei.

321
20:26.510 --> 20:27.310
Exactly.

322
20:30.790 --> 20:31.590
Later,

323
20:32.350 --> 20:35.200
the Liluo demon-men told Tang Wei what happened

324
20:35.350 --> 20:36.550
back then.

325
20:38.110 --> 20:39.920
The Young Master had long wanted revenge,

326
20:39.920 --> 20:41.920
but Huang, Jiang, and the others held

327
20:41.920 --> 20:43.310
high positions and great power back then.

328
20:43.310 --> 20:44.590
Moreover, my master

329
20:44.960 --> 20:46.550
saved the Young Master's life

330
20:46.550 --> 20:47.880
and raised him,

331
20:48.160 --> 20:48.960
so

332
20:49.110 --> 20:52.310
the Young Master couldn't bring himself to hurt the Master.

333
20:52.310 --> 20:53.840
Therefore, he kept waiting

334
20:54.030 --> 20:55.160
and enduring it all

335
20:56.310 --> 20:57.590
until 10 years ago.

336
20:59.880 --> 21:01.220
Until 10 years ago,

337
21:01.720 --> 21:03.550
he finally made a move against Master Tang?

338
21:03.550 --> 21:04.160
Nope,

339
21:04.160 --> 21:05.760
Master Tang died of illness.

340
21:06.480 --> 21:07.550
Over the decades,

341
21:07.960 --> 21:08.920
the Young Master inherited

342
21:08.920 --> 21:11.850
all my master's techniques in crafting and carving.

343
21:11.880 --> 21:12.680
So he faked

344
21:12.700 --> 21:16.050
master's ascension to Heaven on a wooden bird

345
21:16.720 --> 21:18.450
and took over Lanyue Pavilion.

346
21:19.240 --> 21:20.030
Therefore,

347
21:20.920 --> 21:22.070
Huang Gang and the others

348
21:22.070 --> 21:23.480
firmly believed in the cultivation

349
21:23.480 --> 21:24.880
to immortality Tang Wei said

350
21:24.880 --> 21:25.880
only because

351
21:26.960 --> 21:28.550
they witnessed Tang Yiming's ascension

352
21:28.550 --> 21:31.410
to the immortal realm with their own eyes back then?

353
21:33.880 --> 21:35.920
Back then, in the secret chamber of the Imperial Palace,

354
21:35.920 --> 21:36.880
the Young Master's mother

355
21:36.880 --> 21:39.070
died in fear.

356
21:40.480 --> 21:41.640
So the Young Master

357
21:42.240 --> 21:43.510
wanted them to taste

358
21:43.510 --> 21:44.640
that feeling, too.

359
21:51.640 --> 21:52.440
I think

360
21:53.790 --> 21:54.720
Tang Wei must've

361
21:55.720 --> 21:57.550
lived in agony all these years.

362
21:58.110 --> 21:58.960
His death

363
21:59.790 --> 22:00.920
somehow delivered him

364
22:00.920 --> 22:02.270
from torment.

365
22:02.310 --> 22:03.160
Nonsense.

366
22:03.400 --> 22:04.550
The Young Master got his revenge

367
22:04.550 --> 22:05.960
and died with a smile,

368
22:06.510 --> 22:07.720
not in agony.

369
22:09.350 --> 22:12.270
Divine Constable Qingyang, your life's been smooth sailing.

370
22:12.270 --> 22:14.130
You could never understand this.

371
22:18.160 --> 22:19.640
I understand, of course.

372
22:20.750 --> 22:22.080
I just don't understand

373
22:22.270 --> 22:24.160
why you only remember

374
22:24.350 --> 22:25.750
Young Master Tang's feud

375
22:26.350 --> 22:28.480
but ignore Master Tang's grace.

376
22:31.310 --> 22:33.110
My family's land deed was seized

377
22:33.400 --> 22:35.240
by Master Tang back then,

378
22:35.550 --> 22:38.380
so I was forced to be sold to the Tang family

379
22:38.510 --> 22:39.910
and bullied by everyone.

380
22:40.350 --> 22:41.880
At that time, everyone in the Tang Mansion

381
22:41.880 --> 22:43.240
looked down on me,

382
22:43.920 --> 22:47.120
except for the Young Master, who treated me with respect.

383
22:47.270 --> 22:48.830
So the Young Master's wish

384
22:49.590 --> 22:51.110
is my wish.

385
22:52.350 --> 22:53.510
I see.

386
22:54.160 --> 22:55.360
I've had his revenge.

387
22:56.750 --> 22:57.880
Divine Constable Qingyang,

388
22:57.880 --> 22:58.680
come on!

389
23:00.510 --> 23:02.370
Arrest me and bring me to justice.

390
23:11.350 --> 23:12.270
Butler Qin,

391
23:12.510 --> 23:14.510
since you are okay with being arrested,

392
23:14.510 --> 23:16.510
why have you been hiding here?

393
23:19.720 --> 23:20.650
Because I wanted

394
23:20.790 --> 23:22.350
to lure the Divine Constable Bureau's personnel

395
23:22.350 --> 23:24.340
to the 8th floor of Lanyue Pavilion

396
23:24.480 --> 23:25.550
and tell you

397
23:25.960 --> 23:27.310
what

398
23:27.350 --> 23:29.510
those four people have done.

399
23:29.960 --> 23:33.620
Only when the Divine Constables reveal the truth to the public...

400
23:35.150 --> 23:36.680
can the Young Master and his mother

401
23:36.680 --> 23:37.830
rest

402
23:38.400 --> 23:39.830
in peace.

403
23:42.680 --> 23:44.280
So that's how it is.

404
23:44.350 --> 23:45.370
So,

405
23:46.000 --> 23:48.000
you were afraid we couldn't find you

406
23:48.270 --> 23:49.920
and even spread the news that

407
23:50.510 --> 23:53.000
Butler Qin came to Lanyue Pavilion

408
23:53.000 --> 23:55.200
to mourn for his young master 3 days ago.

409
23:57.070 --> 23:58.930
I've been waiting not only for you

410
23:59.310 --> 24:00.110
but also

411
24:02.720 --> 24:04.050
for the people of Liluo.

412
24:09.310 --> 24:10.110
Zhenzhu!

413
24:10.110 --> 24:10.880
Yan,

414
24:11.070 --> 24:11.920
at the Tang Mansion,

415
24:11.920 --> 24:13.630
we found Qin Dayuan's body

416
24:13.920 --> 24:15.750
as well as the Liluo treasures.

417
24:16.030 --> 24:16.920
What?

418
24:17.110 --> 24:18.910
It even involved the treasures?

419
24:22.550 --> 24:25.750
If Dark Night comes to search this place,

420
24:26.240 --> 24:27.030
then

421
24:27.310 --> 24:29.680
the Divine Constable Bureau can easily catch them like rats in a trap

422
24:29.680 --> 24:32.030
and purge Dark Night in one fell swoop.

423
24:33.070 --> 24:34.090
However...

424
24:35.680 --> 24:37.550
Butler Qin, how did you know

425
24:37.960 --> 24:39.400
that once you disappeared,

426
24:39.400 --> 24:40.350
Dark Night

427
24:40.350 --> 24:42.550
would definitely come looking for you?

428
24:44.790 --> 24:46.250
What do you think, My Lord?

429
24:54.310 --> 24:57.680
For the Tang household to have the money to build this Lanyue Pavilion,

430
24:57.680 --> 24:59.440
they must have made a killing.

431
25:01.750 --> 25:02.640
Could it be...

432
25:05.960 --> 25:07.160
The Liluo treasures?

433
25:26.510 --> 25:27.710
The Liluo treasures?

434
25:28.070 --> 25:29.750
There really are the Liluo treasures!

435
25:29.750 --> 25:31.400
My master secretly brought back the treasures

436
25:31.400 --> 25:32.400
of the Kingdom of Liluo

437
25:32.400 --> 25:34.750
and hid them in the secret chamber of the Tang Mansion.

438
25:34.750 --> 25:35.750
The people of Dark Night

439
25:35.750 --> 25:37.310
are desperate to get the treasures

440
25:37.310 --> 25:39.400
to bankroll the overthrow of Great Shi.

441
25:39.400 --> 25:40.550
But they have no clue about

442
25:40.550 --> 25:42.480
the whereabouts of the treasures.

443
25:43.480 --> 25:45.510
After Master Tang and Mr. Tang died,

444
25:45.960 --> 25:47.200
you're the only one who knows

445
25:47.200 --> 25:48.930
the location of the treasures.

446
25:49.110 --> 25:50.370
When you disappeared,

447
25:50.400 --> 25:51.750
the Liluo demon-men

448
25:51.750 --> 25:53.110
had to go find you.

449
25:53.750 --> 25:55.950
I had already arranged it before I came.

450
25:56.480 --> 25:59.480
The treasure is left to the Divine Constable Bureau.

451
26:06.590 --> 26:07.400
Weird.

452
26:07.720 --> 26:09.680
It was just reasonable for Tang Wei

453
26:10.440 --> 26:11.880
to take revenge on Great Shi.

454
26:11.880 --> 26:12.680
But

455
26:13.480 --> 26:14.480
why would he want

456
26:14.480 --> 26:16.880
to eliminate the Liluo demon-men who helped him

457
26:16.880 --> 26:18.270
take revenge as well?

458
26:19.070 --> 26:20.070
What do you think?

459
26:21.480 --> 26:23.070
Qingyang should still be up there.

460
26:23.070 --> 26:23.920
Calm down.

461
26:23.920 --> 26:25.510
Meng is on his way here with the body.

462
26:25.510 --> 26:26.830
How can I calm down?

463
26:27.750 --> 26:29.200
I'm almost worried sick!

464
26:41.880 --> 26:43.340
The Liluo imperial family

465
26:43.750 --> 26:46.590
used Tang Wei's mother as a scapegoat,

466
26:46.960 --> 26:48.920
so they could escape unscathed.

467
26:50.070 --> 26:50.880
Therefore,

468
26:52.110 --> 26:53.830
to Tang Wei and his mother,

469
26:54.480 --> 26:55.310
the Liluo imperial family

470
26:55.310 --> 26:57.110
were also their bitter enemies,

471
26:57.680 --> 26:59.680
just like Huang Gang and the others.

472
27:08.480 --> 27:09.640
Butler Qin,

473
27:10.880 --> 27:13.280
there is one more thing I'd like to confirm.

474
27:13.510 --> 27:14.880
Who on earth

475
27:15.350 --> 27:16.480
is the former citizen of Liluo

476
27:16.480 --> 27:18.480
who had been in contact with Tang Wei

477
27:18.880 --> 27:20.240
over the past 3 decades?

478
27:28.310 --> 27:29.440
Let me think.

479
28:01.160 --> 28:02.000
Gunpowder?

480
28:03.460 --> 28:04.700
My wish is fulfilled.

481
28:05.310 --> 28:07.040
Once I activate the mechanism,

482
28:07.310 --> 28:09.910
the entire Lanyue Pavilion will be blown away!

483
28:09.920 --> 28:11.240
Wouldn't it be a pity

484
28:11.480 --> 28:12.960
to destroy the Top 1 Pavilion

485
28:12.960 --> 28:14.240
just like this?

486
28:14.240 --> 28:15.000
Pity?

487
28:15.350 --> 28:16.230
Not at all.

488
28:17.510 --> 28:18.970
What a pity that the people

489
28:19.070 --> 28:20.400
of Liluo didn't come.

490
28:21.960 --> 28:22.750
Wait!

491
28:23.350 --> 28:24.830
You can kill me,

492
28:25.310 --> 28:26.400
but you cannot stop me

493
28:26.400 --> 28:27.880
from igniting the gunpowder.

494
28:27.880 --> 28:30.110
You've taken such great pains for this all these years.

495
28:30.110 --> 28:31.830
I don't want you to end up

496
28:31.850 --> 28:33.710
dying without knowing the truth.

497
28:34.110 --> 28:35.880
You have waited for years.

498
28:35.880 --> 28:37.220
It doesn't hurt to wait

499
28:37.550 --> 28:38.510
just a bit longer, right?

500
28:38.510 --> 28:39.270
Li Si!

501
28:39.920 --> 28:41.320
There is gunpowder here!

502
28:41.830 --> 28:42.640
No!

503
28:43.110 --> 28:44.370
Don't come any closer!

504
28:45.320 --> 28:46.440
No one can stop me

505
28:46.440 --> 28:47.900
from reuniting with my young master.

506
28:47.900 --> 28:48.830
"Young master"?

507
28:48.980 --> 28:50.830
Is Tang Wei really your young master?

508
28:50.830 --> 28:51.950
Or rather,

509
28:52.240 --> 28:53.880
are you really Qin Dayuan?

510
28:54.070 --> 28:55.400
Are you out of your mind?

511
28:56.160 --> 28:57.640
He is my young master,

512
28:58.110 --> 29:00.200
the one I have followed all my life.

513
29:00.310 --> 29:01.310
In this case,

514
29:01.680 --> 29:02.880
see who this is.

515
29:03.310 --> 29:04.110
Bring it over.

516
29:15.680 --> 29:17.240
Yan, go find the Chief.

517
29:17.240 --> 29:17.920
Got it.

518
29:20.830 --> 29:21.640
What...

519
29:24.960 --> 29:26.110
What happened?

520
29:28.270 --> 29:29.480
What's this all about?

521
29:29.480 --> 29:30.400
Sir,

522
29:31.310 --> 29:33.910
Kongyuzi, whom you killed with your own hands,

523
29:33.920 --> 29:36.050
was not your wife, actually.

524
29:36.200 --> 29:36.880
You...

525
29:37.990 --> 29:39.520
What are you talking about?

526
29:53.920 --> 29:55.720
The moon's reflection turns into the flower in the mirror,

527
29:55.720 --> 29:57.440
replacing old forms with new faces.

528
29:57.440 --> 29:58.750
As one of the Five Wonders of Liluo,

529
29:58.750 --> 30:00.880
the Illusion of Mirrors and Water is indeed

530
30:00.880 --> 30:03.680
an unparalleled disguise technique in the world.

531
30:04.240 --> 30:05.030
Zhenzhu,

532
30:05.880 --> 30:07.280
check the back of his head

533
30:07.510 --> 30:09.570
and see if there's anything unusual.

534
30:37.350 --> 30:39.610
He is really not Qin Dayuan, as expected.

535
30:41.640 --> 30:42.880
I am Qin Dayuan.

536
30:42.880 --> 30:44.440
I-I am Qin Dayuan.

537
30:45.110 --> 30:46.680
The Illusion of Mirrors and Water

538
30:46.680 --> 30:47.680
can completely alter

539
30:47.680 --> 30:49.550
a person's skin, flesh,

540
30:49.550 --> 30:50.780
and even bones,

541
30:50.880 --> 30:51.640
making the one truly

542
30:51.640 --> 30:53.170
become a different person.

543
30:53.680 --> 30:54.830
Since it is sorcery,

544
30:54.880 --> 30:56.400
how could it be used in Tianhuang City

545
30:56.400 --> 30:58.260
under the Absolute Prohibition?

546
31:00.070 --> 31:02.270
This is just a martial arts mental technique,

547
31:02.270 --> 31:03.400
not sorcery.

548
31:04.270 --> 31:05.510
The Illusion of Mirrors and Water

549
31:05.510 --> 31:07.310
can not only change his appearance

550
31:07.310 --> 31:09.580
but also his figure and voice?

551
31:09.750 --> 31:12.010
What... What did I originally look like?

552
31:12.110 --> 31:13.030
I want to see.

553
31:20.240 --> 31:21.310
See for yourself.

554
31:30.640 --> 31:32.270
Who is he? Who?

555
31:33.070 --> 31:33.880
You still

556
31:33.880 --> 31:35.480
haven't recalled anything?

557
31:36.680 --> 31:39.680
You are the former Minister of Works,

558
31:40.100 --> 31:41.970
the world's greatest craftsman,

559
31:42.270 --> 31:45.000
Lord Tang Yiming.

560
31:46.510 --> 31:47.790
He is Tang Yiming?

561
31:48.110 --> 31:48.750
But...

562
31:48.750 --> 31:50.590
But Tang Yiming is already dead,

563
31:50.720 --> 31:51.510
right?

564
31:52.960 --> 31:53.890
T-That's right,

565
31:54.310 --> 31:55.910
Tang Yiming is already dead.

566
31:56.750 --> 31:57.680
He is right in...

567
32:00.070 --> 32:03.680
The Illusion of Mirrors and Water combined with the soul-shifting hypnotism

568
32:03.680 --> 32:05.070
can make you firmly believe

569
32:05.070 --> 32:06.680
that you are someone else.

570
32:09.110 --> 32:10.570
Please take a closer look.

571
32:15.550 --> 32:17.200
Do you remember now?

572
32:43.110 --> 32:44.640
Why is it empty?

573
32:45.510 --> 32:47.640
With the Liluo people's help, Tang Wei

574
32:47.960 --> 32:50.270
learned the Illusion of Mirrors and Water.

575
32:50.270 --> 32:52.160
Ten years ago, when you were seriously ill,

576
32:52.160 --> 32:54.440
he seized the chance to alter your appearance

577
32:54.440 --> 32:56.790
and applied the soul-shifting hypnotism.

578
32:56.790 --> 32:57.590
This way,

579
32:57.680 --> 32:59.510
you were completely convinced

580
32:59.510 --> 33:01.680
that you were the butler of the Tang Mansion,

581
33:01.680 --> 33:02.790
Qin Dayuan.

582
33:02.880 --> 33:03.920
The proof is that

583
33:04.510 --> 33:05.400
the Divine Constable Bureau

584
33:05.400 --> 33:07.240
couldn't find Tang Yiming's corpse anywhere.

585
33:07.240 --> 33:08.400
He's not dead,

586
33:08.440 --> 33:10.240
so there's no corpse of his.

587
33:10.510 --> 33:12.440
Tang Wei wanted Tang Yiming to live

588
33:12.640 --> 33:13.880
and even become another person

589
33:13.880 --> 33:15.110
to help him take revenge

590
33:15.110 --> 33:16.310
and kill the accomplices like Huang Gang

591
33:16.310 --> 33:17.110
and Jiang Zeshui.

592
33:17.110 --> 33:18.370
But come to think of it.

593
33:19.070 --> 33:20.110
If we hadn't exposed

594
33:20.110 --> 33:21.310
the Illusion of Mirrors and Water,

595
33:21.310 --> 33:22.510
Tang Yiming would have died

596
33:22.510 --> 33:23.830
believing that he was Qin Dayuan.

597
33:23.830 --> 33:24.720
In this case,

598
33:24.920 --> 33:25.750
wouldn't Tang Wei's revenge

599
33:25.750 --> 33:27.000
come to nothing?

600
33:52.480 --> 33:54.510
Where did you find this corpse

601
33:55.270 --> 33:56.920
and the luminous pearl?

602
33:56.920 --> 33:59.270
There is a secret chamber in Tang Wei's room.

603
33:59.270 --> 34:00.960
Tang Wei left a will stating that no one

604
34:00.960 --> 34:02.110
is allowed to enter his room other than

605
34:02.110 --> 34:03.640
those from the Divine Constable Bureau,

606
34:03.640 --> 34:05.680
not even Qin Dayuan.

607
34:13.320 --> 34:14.400
I see.

608
34:15.440 --> 34:16.440
This way,

609
34:16.880 --> 34:18.880
even the silliest person would know

610
34:18.880 --> 34:21.210
that there is a secret hidden in that room.

611
34:21.960 --> 34:23.630
Turns out that Tang Wei had long planned

612
34:23.630 --> 34:25.630
for the Divine Constable Bureau to find the body.

613
34:25.630 --> 34:27.389
Once we find the body,

614
34:27.550 --> 34:30.000
we'd know that he is fake Qin Dayuan.

615
34:30.110 --> 34:32.639
There is a secret left in this luminous pearl.

616
34:32.659 --> 34:33.469
So,

617
34:34.320 --> 34:35.670
even if we failed to expose

618
34:35.670 --> 34:38.230
the trick of the Illusion of Mirrors and Water,

619
34:38.230 --> 34:40.489
we would still be able to learn the truth.

620
34:40.670 --> 34:42.000
What if I say this item

621
34:42.030 --> 34:44.440
is related to Liluo?

622
34:52.110 --> 34:52.920
So,

623
34:53.880 --> 34:54.960
Mr. Tang left the jade pendant

624
34:54.960 --> 34:56.280
to me

625
34:57.280 --> 34:58.810
actually for this purpose.

626
34:59.510 --> 35:00.610
He knew we would definitely

627
35:00.610 --> 35:02.010
find the luminous pearl,

628
35:02.070 --> 35:03.670
and he also knew you would definitely discover

629
35:03.670 --> 35:06.870
the mechanism of the luminous pearl and the jade pendant.

630
35:40.150 --> 35:42.320
Tang Wei recorded how he used

631
35:42.760 --> 35:45.090
the Illusion of Mirrors and Water to alter

632
35:46.150 --> 35:47.230
Lord Tang's appearance

633
35:47.230 --> 35:48.430
in the form of images.

634
35:50.480 --> 35:52.140
The Tang family's mechanisms

635
35:52.500 --> 35:54.320
are indeed ingenious.

636
36:05.110 --> 36:05.710
Can't believe

637
36:05.710 --> 36:06.960
he recorded all the crimes

638
36:06.960 --> 36:08.320
he committed one by one.

639
36:09.880 --> 36:11.960
As long as we discover the images stored

640
36:11.960 --> 36:13.290
in this luminous pearl,

641
36:13.670 --> 36:15.590
the whole story and the truth

642
36:16.070 --> 36:17.670
will just come to light.

643
36:18.110 --> 36:20.110
I taught him the mechanism skills.

644
36:20.960 --> 36:22.760
This child was really talented.

645
36:24.110 --> 36:25.880
He was clever

646
36:26.680 --> 36:28.140
and surpassed his master.

647
36:28.880 --> 36:30.710
He made this for me to see.

648
36:31.110 --> 36:32.110
He wanted me

649
36:32.750 --> 36:35.320
to regret it for the rest of my life.

650
36:37.550 --> 36:38.440
Lord Tang,

651
36:39.360 --> 36:40.630
please go back with us.

652
36:42.960 --> 36:44.760
Although you killed General Hu,

653
36:44.760 --> 36:46.320
Lord Huang, and Lord Jiang,

654
36:46.630 --> 36:47.880
your mind was controlled by someone else.

655
36:47.880 --> 36:49.080
You are also a victim.

656
36:49.280 --> 36:50.550
You won't receive a heavy sentence.

657
36:50.550 --> 36:51.710
What is

658
36:54.630 --> 36:55.590
the point

659
36:57.320 --> 36:59.440
of living for me?

660
37:04.280 --> 37:05.110
Lord Tang,

661
37:05.710 --> 37:07.670
Mr. Tang was scheming,

662
37:07.880 --> 37:08.670
but

663
37:12.150 --> 37:13.400
he never forgot the bond you shared

664
37:13.400 --> 37:15.000
as father and son.

665
37:15.880 --> 37:17.880
The bond we shared as father and son?

666
37:19.670 --> 37:20.880
You are wrong.

667
37:21.440 --> 37:24.000
Wei didn't hate Huang Gang,

668
37:24.510 --> 37:25.670
Hu Hai,

669
37:26.670 --> 37:28.110
or Jiang Zeshui.

670
37:30.280 --> 37:31.880
He hated me.

671
37:32.750 --> 37:34.440
He hated me for saving him,

672
37:34.480 --> 37:35.590
raising him,

673
37:36.070 --> 37:38.230
and making him suffer

674
37:39.920 --> 37:43.400
in this living hell for 47 years.

675
37:45.840 --> 37:46.710
You are wrong.

676
37:49.840 --> 37:50.630
Look.

677
38:02.360 --> 38:03.110
I will definitely

678
38:03.110 --> 38:04.910
give you the best of everything.

679
38:05.550 --> 38:06.880
I will make it up to you

680
38:07.120 --> 38:09.250
and raise you to be an outstanding man.

681
38:16.280 --> 38:17.110
This is...

682
38:22.880 --> 38:24.280
Father, try this.

683
38:24.280 --> 38:25.400
It's really delicious.

684
38:25.400 --> 38:26.370
No, thanks.

685
38:26.480 --> 38:27.480
Just take a bite.

686
38:27.480 --> 38:27.960
Just one bite.

687
38:27.960 --> 38:29.440
Alright, I'll take a bite.

688
38:30.030 --> 38:31.770
[Dignity]

689
38:42.440 --> 38:43.230
Father!

690
38:45.550 --> 38:46.360
Wei.

691
38:51.710 --> 38:54.740
[Dignity]

692
39:17.920 --> 39:18.670
Wei,

693
39:19.280 --> 39:20.510
I will be away for a few days.

694
39:20.510 --> 39:22.370
Don't forget to do your homework.

695
39:24.920 --> 39:26.120
Don't worry, Father.

696
39:44.440 --> 39:46.040
Although Tang Wei hated you,

697
39:46.920 --> 39:48.150
he remembered

698
39:48.150 --> 39:49.230
every moment

699
39:49.760 --> 39:51.030
you shared.

700
39:51.110 --> 39:51.920
That's right.

701
39:52.880 --> 39:55.080
The Liluo luminous pearl is priceless.

702
39:55.280 --> 39:56.760
He insisted on making this mechanism

703
39:56.760 --> 39:58.620
even at the cost of destroying it.

704
39:59.070 --> 40:01.000
It's enough to prove that your bond

705
40:01.030 --> 40:03.320
mattered so much to him.

706
40:05.670 --> 40:06.510
Wei,

707
40:07.360 --> 40:08.670
you painstakingly

708
40:09.280 --> 40:11.670
laid out your plans for the past 10 years.

709
40:14.030 --> 40:18.030
And you left alone,

710
40:18.670 --> 40:20.030
without even knowing

711
40:22.110 --> 40:24.590
if your plans would succeed.

712
40:25.840 --> 40:26.630
Wei,

713
40:27.230 --> 40:30.280
you were just like how you used to be when you were a child.

714
40:30.280 --> 40:32.590
I am coming to reunite with you now.

715
40:46.000 --> 40:46.800
My Lord.

716
41:19.440 --> 41:21.240
Perhaps living was the real pain

717
41:22.070 --> 41:23.440
to him, just as he said.

718
41:25.320 --> 41:26.510
Before he died,

719
41:27.510 --> 41:30.110
he learned that Tang Wei still cared about him.

720
41:30.150 --> 41:30.960
I suppose...

721
41:32.840 --> 41:34.670
he died without regrets.

722
41:40.310 --> 41:41.820
[God of Hatred, Haiqu]

723
41:57.280 --> 41:58.280
-Chief. -Chief.

724
41:59.110 --> 42:00.280
Tang Yiming is dead,

725
42:00.320 --> 42:01.880
but we still haven't figured out

726
42:01.880 --> 42:03.140
who the former citizen

727
42:03.150 --> 42:04.630
of Liluo he mentioned really is.

728
42:04.630 --> 42:06.670
This case is not solved yet.

729
42:10.510 --> 42:11.280
Li Si,

730
42:11.840 --> 42:12.670
you once said that

731
42:12.670 --> 42:14.000
a middle-aged man with a square face

732
42:14.000 --> 42:14.860
and narrow eyes

733
42:15.280 --> 42:16.940
showed up at Lanyue Pavilion.

734
42:17.360 --> 42:18.630
I asked him before,

735
42:19.550 --> 42:20.920
and he said he forgot.

736
42:20.920 --> 42:22.230
How would he confess?

737
42:22.670 --> 42:24.270
He must be hiding something.

738
42:24.670 --> 42:26.190
Seems like we still need

739
42:26.190 --> 42:27.110
to arrest everyone

740
42:27.110 --> 42:29.150
in the Tang Mansion for strict interrogation.

741
42:29.150 --> 42:30.510
With so many people at Lanyue Pavilion,

742
42:30.510 --> 42:33.440
someone must have seen that former citizen of Liluo.

743
42:36.030 --> 42:37.840
I wonder if you agree, Chief.

744
42:49.760 --> 42:52.290
So you've been thinking about

745
42:52.510 --> 42:54.280
that person outside the Tianshu Pavilion

746
42:54.280 --> 42:55.510
and suspecting me

747
42:55.920 --> 42:57.980
ever since the Lanyue Pavilion case.

748
42:58.510 --> 42:59.440
Then,

749
43:00.030 --> 43:01.110
follow me.

750
43:26.370 --> 43:29.140
[Tianshu Pavilion]

751
44:22.760 --> 44:23.550
You're here.

752
44:24.330 --> 44:25.770
What took you so long?

753
44:26.590 --> 44:27.400
Master,

754
44:29.360 --> 44:31.220
I am looking for a middle-aged man

755
44:31.630 --> 44:33.840
with a square face and narrow eyes.

756
44:36.550 --> 44:37.440
Too bad

757
44:38.280 --> 44:40.280
I haven't seen such a person.

758
44:45.550 --> 44:47.010
The person I'm looking for

759
44:48.030 --> 44:49.110
once stayed

760
44:50.670 --> 44:52.730
at Lanyue Pavilion several days ago.

761
44:54.840 --> 44:55.970
What a coincidence.

762
44:57.230 --> 44:58.840
I actually went

763
44:58.840 --> 45:01.030
to Lanyue Pavilion the other day.

764
45:02.710 --> 45:05.280
It's the Top 1 Pavilion in Great Shi, where you can

765
45:05.280 --> 45:07.610
go up high and enjoy the view from up there.

766
45:07.670 --> 45:09.110
And best of all,

767
45:10.510 --> 45:11.440
it's quiet.

768
45:14.070 --> 45:15.800
It's much more to my liking

769
45:17.510 --> 45:19.970
compared to your Star-Gathering Pavilion.

770
45:26.760 --> 45:28.220
The person I'm looking for

771
45:30.030 --> 45:31.230
is from Liluo.
